Why would a president care about one CEO?

8
00:00:17,094 --> 00:00:20,250
Because Nvidia is worth around four trillion dollars.

9
00:00:20,554 --> 00:00:22,751
That's more than the yearly output of all but

10
00:00:22,771 --> 00:00:24,418
a handful of countries.

11
00:00:24,559 --> 00:00:26,037
We've seen this before.

12
00:00:26,057 --> 00:00:28,765
In 1907, when Wall Street panicked,

13
00:00:28,785 --> 00:00:29,183
J.P.

14
00:00:29,203 --> 00:00:32,062
Morgan locked bankers in his library until they agreed

15
00:00:32,082 --> 00:00:33,485
to save the system.

16
00:00:33,696 --> 00:00:37,716
In 2008, Washington set aside seven hundred billion dollars

17
00:00:37,736 --> 00:00:40,532
to rescue banks it called too big to fail.

18
00:00:40,743 --> 00:00:42,790
Now the question isn't whether a company is too

19
